                            <comment id="14639964" author="alexlevenson" created="Fri, 24 Jul 2015 05:32:44 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Thanks for the fixes. I think this opens up the discussion of: do we need to / want to continue supporting java 6 in parquet? &lt;br/&gt;
That might be worth starting a thread on the mailing list about.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14639982" author="nezihyigitbasi" created="Fri, 24 Jul 2015 06:00:23 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Totally agreed. Since Parquet can already be compiled with Java 7 (and it has long been since Java 6 is EOL), it seems like it&apos;s time to move.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
